<alcuin. carm. 39.1>	Nec tu quippe tuum curasti, filia, Flaccum:
<alcuin. carm. 39.2>	Vester abit toto tremulus, heu, corpore vatis,
<alcuin. carm. 39.3>	Vergilii resonans tacito vix carmine versum:
<alcuin. carm. 39.4>	Me circum validus ventus, nix, undique nimbus.
<alcuin. carm. 39.5>	Hanc tamen iniuriam poteris purgare precando:
<alcuin. carm. 39.6>	Si Regenbrectum possis servare magistrum,
<alcuin. carm. 39.7>	Serva sic vestro patrono et praesule magno:
<alcuin. carm. 39.8>	Viribus et manibus, securi tribulaque palaque
<alcuin. carm. 39.9>	Cetera turba sui populi mox pergat in hostem,
<alcuin. carm. 39.10>	Ille operi insistat canuto vertice tantum:
<alcuin. carm. 39.11>	Haec, rogo, perficiens valeas, mea Delia, semper!
